  "body": "This PR adds support for configuring output power offsets - mostly useful for devices with external power amplifiers. It supports both linear configuration (with a single offset value), as well as configuration via LUT.\r\n\r\nDraft because it is currently completely untested, and so far only implements SX126x and LR2021.\r\n\r\nCloses #1840",
